### latest observations (public)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/observations/latest

### bulk observations (admin or scoped API token)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/observations?page=1&per_page=100&station_ids={{STATION_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.cookies.access_token.value}}

### bulk observations (API key)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/observations?page=1&per_page=100&api_key={{API_KEY}}
